称呼:Dear Mr Smith,
第1句 来意:On behalf of …, I am writing to invite you to …
第2-3句 信息:The festival will be held in … from … to … Visitors will be able to enjoy …
第4句 请求回复:It would be a great honour … Please reply to confirm …
落款:Yours sincerely, Li Hua', 2, 'elective1', 'U4', 'fltrp');

